    description: "The pyffi linker (pyffi.py, 544 lines) has zero test-file awareness: all 10 C_stdlib FFI `calls` edges it emits in self-analysis (fopen/fwrite/popen/etc.) originate from the linker's OWN test file test_pyffi_linker.py, not from production code. Fix: add an is_test_file gate to pyffi.py so it skips test files. Same root FAMILY as the broader 'linkers/patterns scan test files' theme but a DISTINCT producer with its own fix site (pyffi.py); cross-linked, not folded. Surfaced via dogfooding; blinded severity 3/5."  # 3deb
